<ol class="steps">
  <li><span class="k">Step 1</span><h3>Sign up</h3><p>Create your free shop account with your email, shop name and website. No card needed.</p><p><a href={SITE.signup}>Start free</a></p></li>
  <li><span class="k">Step 2</span><h3>Set your prices</h3><p>Start from a starter price grid and change it to match how you already price jobs: colours, quantities, fees and minimums.</p></li>
  <li><span class="k">Step 3</span><h3>Put it on your site</h3><p>Paste one line of code into your website, or install the WordPress plugin. Style it to match your site's colours, font and corners.</p><p><a href="/for-shops">Install guide</a></p></li>
</ol>
<p class="prom">No training <i>·</i> A flat monthly price <i>·</i> Export your data anytime</p>
